## B2. Pin-fin baseline calibration (per switch, 8 x 4.5 mm SiC dies = 1.62 cm2 on a 14 cm2 cell)

Calibrated pin-fin h_eff (base-referenced) = 22.3 kW/m2K -> Rth mean 0.1000, max 0.1058 K/W; die-referenced R'' = 0.162 cm2K/W
Zukauskas cross-check (2 mm pins, 3.0 x 2.6 mm staggered, 8 mm tall, 120 mm frontal width, no bypass): Re_d 778, h 9.8, eta 0.53, h_eff 39 kW/m2K; with 30-50 % tip bypass ~20-27 kW/m2K -> calibration is plausible
  sensitivity: pin-fin base 2 mm -> calibrated h_eff 23.4 kW/m2K
  sensitivity: pin-fin base 4 mm -> calibrated h_eff 22.0 kW/m2K

