Published anchors: Infineon FS01MR12A8MA2B 0.103 typ / 0.113 max K/W per switch (10 L/min, 60 C); NREL WEG jet impingement ~0.15 cm2K/W (die-ref.); EPFL manifold-microchannel SiC module 9.85 mm2K/W = 0.099 cm2K/W (water, 2.16 L/min, lab).

Base thickness sweep (core A h_eff, sinter attach): 0.5 mm 0.0907, 0.8 mm 0.0885, 1.0 mm 0.0874, 1.5 mm 0.0855, 2.0 mm 0.0844, 3.0 mm 0.0836
Base thickness sweep (pin-fin h_eff, solder): 1.0 mm 0.1075, 2.0 mm 0.1021, 3.0 mm 0.1000, 4.0 mm 0.0995, 5.0 mm 0.0999

Die-area sensitivity (recalibrate pin-fin h each time; relative gain of PE-DS core A):
  SiC 1.22 cm2/switch: pin-fin h 29.5 kW/m2K; PE-DS Rth 0.0968 -> -3 %
  SiC 1.62 cm2/switch: pin-fin h 22.3 kW/m2K; PE-DS Rth 0.0874 -> -13 %
  SiC 2.03 cm2/switch: pin-fin h 19.1 kW/m2K; PE-DS Rth 0.0813 -> -19 %

