## B6. Dielectric (PAO-2, 65 C) vs WEG 50/50 in core A (10 L/min and at equal caloric rise)

- WEG 50/50 @ 65C at 10.0 L/min: h_eff 33 kW/m2K, Rth(j-f) PE-DS 0.0874 K/W, dT_out 9.7 K, dP 1.5 kPa
- PAO-2 @ 65C at 10.0 L/min: h_eff 13 kW/m2K, Rth(j-f) PE-DS 0.1357 K/W, dT_out 20.2 K, dP 1.1 kPa
- PAO-2 @ 65C at 20.8 L/min: h_eff 15 kW/m2K, Rth(j-f) PE-DS 0.1265 K/W, dT_out 9.7 K, dP 4.8 kPa
- pin-fin in PAO at 10 L/min: h ratio 0.32 -> h_eff 7.1 kW/m2K, Rth 0.1736 K/W

